Thanks for your interest in the 2003 Security Conference
Birds-of-a-Feather program. BoF's will be held:

Tuesday, August 5th
6:00pm to 10:00pm

Wednesday, August 6th
7:00pm to 11:00pm

Thusday, August 7th
8:00pm to 11:00pm

Please send me the following information so we can confirm your BoF:

1) What day would you like to schedule your BoF?
2) Would you like a one or two hour BoF time slot?
3) What time would you like to begin your BoF?
4) What is the title of your BoF?
5) What is the name & affiliation of the BoF presenter?
6) How many people do you think may attend?

PLEASE NOTE: We do not provide an LCD PROJECTOR for your BoF. We will
provide an overhead projector and screen. If possible, please bring
your own transparencies.
Hi,

I'd like to schedule a BoF for discussing SELinux issues at the next
USENIX Security Symposium.  Any of the times should work...

Thanks,
Trent.

